      "content": "okay, okay, i'm calling 911 now. but wait—you're so sure it's an aneurysm? my doctor told me last year that my abdominal wall is just thin and that's why i can see my pulse sometimes when i've eaten a big meal. could it just be that combined with the kidney stone pain? i'm really scared to go to the ER if i don't actually need to, the bill will be huge.",
